<title>USA: W.W. Grainger enters $50 mln supply pact.</title>
<headline>W.W. Grainger enters $50 mln supply pact.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>W.W. Grainger Inc, an industrial supply distributor, said it entered a three-month maintenance repair operating supply agreement in February with Premier Purchasing Group LP, a large healthcare alliance.</p>
<p>W.W. Grainger estimates the value of the agreement at more than $50 million.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
